      "title": "Lincoln Memorial University Applicant Portal",
      "description": "Lincoln Memorial University Applicant Portal | Security Officer, Orange Park, FL (Armed) Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA) Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA) LMU Annual Security Availability Know Your Rights Security Officer, Orange Park, FL (Armed) Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Security Officer, Orange Park, FL (Armed) Department SECURITY Position Category Staff Full Time Job Description The Security Officer (Armed) shall maintain a working knowledge and comply with all LMU handbooks. The Security Officer (Armed) will conduct the day-to-day activities to ensure a secure campus Required Qualifications High school diploma; valid drivers license; must pass a psychological evaluation according to state requirements; must successfully pass a background check; must pass drug test. Preferred Qualifications law enforcement and/or security training; must successfully the Armed Guard Training Program Physical Demands Campus Orange Park Florida Job Duty Job Duty Promote the mission of Lincoln Memorial University to all faculty, staff, students and to the community at large Job Duty must be able to fire a weapon accurately Job Duty must be able to defend himself/herself and others with and without the use of deadly force Job Duty promote effective working relationships among faculty, staff and students Job Duty participate on University committees in the absences of the chief Job Duty maintain knowledge and compliance with faculty/staff policy manual, Security SOP , student handbook, and other policy manuals Job Duty conduct regular security rounds of all property Job Duty maintain security of all keys and key access Job Duty sufficiently complete new employee training Job Duty research, report crime and incidents Job Duty responsible for su