      "description": "Lincoln Memorial University Applicant Portal | AHA/ASHI Instructor BLS/ACLS and/or PALS, DCOM-Knoxville Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA) Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA) LMU Annual Security Availability Know Your Rights AHA/ASHI Instructor BLS/ACLS and/or PALS, DCOM-Knoxville Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title AHA/ASHI Instructor BLS/ACLS and/or PALS, DCOM-Knoxville Department AHA Training Center Position Category Staff Part Time Job Description LMU is seeking AHA or ASHI instructors to align with the LMU - DCOM American Heart Association ( AHA ) Training Center for the delivery of AHA and/or ASHI courses. The AHA / ASHI Instructor as assigned is responsible for teaching Basic Life Support, Heartsaver Courses, Advanced Cardiac Life Support, Pediatric Advanced Cardiac Life Support Courses and/or courses for the American Health and Safety Institute Heartsaver and/or Basic Life Support. This is an adjunct employee position and does not qualify for benefits. Required Qualifications *AHA Basic Life Support Instructor and/or Advanced Cardiac Life Support and/or Pediatric Advanced Life Support and/or American Safety Health Institute Heartsaver and/or Basic Life Support Preferred Qualifications Associates/bachelors degree in a healthcare-related field Physical Demands Campus Job Duty Posting Detail Information Posting Number S05226P Job Open Date 08/25/2026 Job Close Date 12/31/2026 Open Until Filled No Special Instructions Summary About the Institution Lincoln Memorial University is a values-based learning community dedicated to providing educational experiences in the liberal arts and professional studies. The main campus is located in Harrogate, Tennessee. For more information about employment opportunities, contact the Office of Human R