    "https://careers.lmunet.edu/postings/46106": {
      "title": "Faculty Assistant, Dental",
      "description": "Lincoln Memorial University Applicant Portal | Faculty Assistant, Dental Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA) Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA) LMU Annual Security Availability Know Your Rights Faculty Assistant, Dental Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Faculty Assistant, Dental Department College of Dental Medicine Position Category Staff Full Time Job Description The Faculty Assistant shall assist multiple faculty members in their day-to-day operations and communication requirements. In addition, this person works closely with College of Dental Medicine Staff and Students. Required Qualifications High School Diplmoa *Skills that are typically valued in this role include excellent organizational abilities, strong communication skills, attention to detail, proficiency with office software (such as Microsoft Office Suite), and the ability to handle multiple tasks efficiently. *Understanding the specific needs and procedures of the College of Dental Medicine will be crucial for success in this role, as it involves supporting the unique administrative and operational aspects of a specialized academic department. Preferred Qualifications Physical Demands Campus LMU Tower Job Duty Job Duty promote the mission of Lincoln Memorial University and the College of Dental Medicine to all faculty, staff, students and to the community at large. Job Duty promote effective working relationships among faculty, staff, and students. Job Duty participate on Dental School committees. Job Duty assist faculty members of the Dental School in carrying out their respective duties in the dental school. Job Duty coordinate with the Executive Assistant to the Dean and the Assistant to the Associate Dean for Academics, as necessary. Job Duty assist with establishing